# Fixture migrated: durable delivery binds its endpoint to the tree's injected state authority, so the source sets an event-log state store at the store path and opens the runtime on that store's `.delivery` log beside it (Core/Service/Service.jet start; Rust Services.rs 4755-4780).
# Fixture migrated: the original 60-second retention is 3600 seconds. The phases run as separate processes, and on a loaded host the accept-to-recover span passed 60 seconds, so the entry expired and retry answered "cannot retry a dead-lettered delivery". No step tests expiry.
fixture: durable_lifecycle_crash_window_recovers_and_replays_one_identity.fixture
